{"step_index":5726,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-23T20:05:11Z","thinking":"Total shortages are substantial, but only a small fraction requires review after matching across warehouses. Remarkably, the review items are all dosage form differences of the same brand, confirming match accuracy. The \"لم يُعثر عليه\" category warrants further investigation.\n\n\nInvestigating the matches, several OCR typos were resolved, like \"جنتازون كريم\" for \"جينتازون كريم\". However, the matching of \"برونكوفين شراب\" with \"برونكوف شراب\" raises concern. Initial hypothesis of an OCR typo might be incorrect; it appears the items are different medications.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"& \"D:\\miniconda3\\envs\\venv\\python.exe\" -c \"import openpyxl; wb = openpyxl.load_workbook('D:/AI_Engineer/Pharmacy-agy/data/processes/PROC-011/results_PROC-011.xlsx'); matched_unq = set(); [matched_unq.add(r[0].value) for s in wb.sheetnames if s not in ['ملخص', 'لم يُعثر عليه', 'يحتاج مراجعة'] for r in list(wb[s].rows)[1:]]; rev_unq = set(r[1].value for r in list(wb['يحتاج مراجعة'].rows)[1:]); nf_unq = set(r[0].value for r in list(wb['لم يُعثر عليه'].rows)[1:]); print('Unique matched shortages:', len(matched_unq)); print('Unique review shortages:', len(rev_unq)); print('Unique not-found shortages:', len(nf_unq)); print('Sum =', len(matched_unq) + len(rev_unq) + len(nf_unq))\"","Cwd":"D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Calculating unique totals across sheets","toolSummary":"Calculate unique totals"}}]}
